::  name       tally max gardens
::  shape      gardens - int (@u32)
::  invariant  Gardens holds at most eight named regions (max_gardens)
::  example    8
::  readers    Tally · Glow Tend · Caravan · Amphora · Ashvini nest-only
::  nib        equinox-e191-tally-tend-v0
::
::  Equinox e191 · nest-only Ashvini under Equinox B — first Tally Glow Tend limb.
::  Names max_gardens from tally/gardens.rye. Does not reimplement the allocator
::  in Glow; the pedestal opens the Tend so later limbs can grow beside Rye.
+$  tally-max-gardens-shape
  $:  gardens=@u32
  ==
